description: 
globs: **/data/**/*.dart
alwaysApply: false
---
---
description: Enforces dependency rules for the Data layer.
globs:
  - "**/data/**/*.dart"
type: AutoAttached
---
Data layer code:
- MUST implement interfaces defined in the Domain layer (Repository interfaces).
- CAN depend on Domain layer entities (for mapping purposes).
- MUST NOT import or depend on any UI layer components (`package:*/ui/**`).
- CAN use specific data handling packages (`dio`, `hive`, `sqflite`, AWS SDKs, etc.).
- MUST handle error mapping from external sources to domain failure types.
- SHOULD implement proper caching strategies where appropriate.
- MUST NOT contain business logic (that belongs in domain layer).
- CAN use Firebase services, GraphQL clients, and REST API clients.